  "chapters": [
    {
      "title": "Chapter 2: Form 16 Decoded",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "title": "Old Regime vs New Regime: How Your Choice Shows Up in Form 16",
          "slug": "old-regime-vs-new-regime-how-your-choice-shows-up-in-form-16",
          "body": [
            {
              "_key": "k1",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "k2",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "In the last lesson, Priya's Form 16 showed ₹1,74,000 of tax under the old regime. She picked it because she pays rent and invests in ELSS and NPS, and \"deductions mean old regime\" is what her colleagues told her. Run the same ₹18 lakh salary through the new regime and the tax is ₹1,50,800. Her choice cost her ₹23,200 in TDS. The good news: the regime printed on Form 16 is not final.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "chart",
              "chartType": "bar",
              "title": "Priya's tax on ₹18 lakh salary, FY 2025-26",
              "yAxisLabel": "Tax including cess (₹)",
              "data": [
                {
                  "_key": "k4",
                  "label": "Old regime (as per Form 16)",
                  "value": 174000
                },
                {
                  "_key": "k6",
                  "label": "New regime",
                  "value": 150800
                }
              ],
              "_key": "k7"
            },
            {
              "_key": "k8",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "k9",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "How Your Employer Decides Which Regime to Use",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_key": "k10",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "k11",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Since FY 2023-24, the new regime has been the default for individuals under section 202 of the Income-tax Act, 2025 (section 115BAC of the 1961 Act). To use the old regime, you have to opt out.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_key": "k12",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "k13",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "For TDS purposes, CBDT Circular 4 of 2023 set out how this works at your workplace:",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_key": "k14",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "k15",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Your employer must ask you at the start of each year which regime you intend to use.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "listItem": "bullet",
              "level": 1
            },
            {
              "_key": "k16",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "k17",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "If you do not reply, your employer must deduct TDS under the new regime.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "listItem": "bullet",
              "level": 1
            },
            {
              "_key": "k18",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "k19",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Once you tell your employer, you cannot change the choice during the year for TDS.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "listItem": "bullet",
              "level": 1
            },
            {
              "_key": "k20",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "k21",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Telling your employer is ",
                  "marks": []
                },
                {
                  "_key": "k22",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "not",
                  "marks": [
                    "strong"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "_key": "k23",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": " the legal choice. That is made separately, when you file your return.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "listItem": "bullet",
              "level": 1
            },
            {
              "_type": "bigIdea",
              "text": "The regime on your Form 16 is only the one your employer used to deduct TDS. The regime you actually pay tax under is the one you choose in your return.",
              "_key": "k24"
            },
            {
              "_key": "k25",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "k26",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Spotting the Regime in Form 16 Part B",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_key": "k27",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "k28",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "You do not need to read the fine print to know which regime was used. Six rows give it away.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
