              ],
              "explanation": "₹12,75,000 minus the ₹75,000 standard deduction leaves taxable income of ₹12,00,000, and the rebate of up to ₹60,000 brings tax to zero.",
              "_key": "k136"
            },
            {
              "_type": "exercise",
